{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-vector-databases","title":"图数据库与向量数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/graph-vector-databases","wordCount":1808,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"图数据库与向量数据库选型\">图数据库与向量数据库选型</h1><p>2026 年数据库市场增长最快的两个细分领域：图数据库（CAGR 18%，预计 2033 年达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>B</mi><mtext>）和向量数据库（</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi><mn>26.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20B）和向量数据库（CAGR 26.4%，预计 2035 年达</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）和向量数据库（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">GR</span><span class=\"mord\">26.4</span></span></span></span></span>24.1B）。两者都解决了关系型和文档数据库的根本盲区——前者处理实体间的关系推理，后者处理高维空间中的相似性检索。它们代表了从「精确匹配」到「关系遍历」和「语义近邻」的查询范式转变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图和向量数据库代表了两种非传统的查询范式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>图数据库</strong>：关系（边）是一等存储实体，多跳遍历复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——适合关系推理</li>\n<li><strong>向量数据库</strong>：存储高维嵌入向量，支持近似最近邻搜索——适合语义检索和 RAG</li>\n<li><strong>融合趋势</strong>：2026 年两者能力互相渗透（Neo4j 加向量索引、GraphRAG 模式），但核心选型仍按主查询模式决定</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"图数据库-关系即一等公民\">图数据库：关系即一等公民</h2><p>图数据库的核心数据模型是<strong>属性图</strong>（Property Graph）或 <strong>RDF 三元组</strong>。与关系型数据库中通过 JOIN 临时计算关系不同，图数据库将关系（边）作为独立的存储实体，使得多跳遍历的复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（k 次 JOIN）降低到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（k 跳 × 平均出度 d）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    U1[用户 Alice] --&gt;|关注| U2[用户 Bob]&#10;    U2 --&gt;|关注| U3[用户 Carol]&#10;    U1 --&gt;|购买| P1[商品 X]&#10;    U2 --&gt;|购买| P1&#10;    U2 --&gt;|购买| P2[商品 Y]&#10;    U3 --&gt;|购买| P2\">graph LR\n    U1[用户 Alice] --&gt;|关注| U2[用户 Bob]\n    U2 --&gt;|关注| U3[用户 Carol]\n    U1 --&gt;|购买| P1[商品 X]\n    U2 --&gt;|购买| P1\n    U2 --&gt;|购买| P2[商品 Y]\n    U3 --&gt;|购买| P2</pre><p>在这个社交电商图中，「Alice 的二度好友购买了哪些她没买过的商品」——这个查询在关系型数据库中需要至少 3 次 JOIN 和复杂的 NOT EXISTS 子查询，而在图数据库中是一次 2-hop 遍历 + 过滤。</p>\n<h3 id=\"图数据库产品对比\">图数据库产品对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>查询语言</th>\n<th>部署模型</th>\n<th>分布式</th>\n<th>ACID 事务</th>\n<th>向量支持</th>\n<th>起步月费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Neo4j AuraDB</td>\n<td>Cypher / GQL</td>\n<td>托管（多云）</td>\n<td>因果集群</td>\n<td>完整 ACID</td>\n<td>向量索引（2024+）</td>\n<td>$65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon Neptune</td>\n<td>Gremlin / SPARQL / openCypher</td>\n<td>AWS 托管</td>\n<td>读副本</td>\n<td>读后写一致</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>~$150</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure Cosmos DB Gremlin</td>\n<td>Gremlin</td>\n<td>Azure 全球分布</td>\n<td>全球复制</td>\n<td>单分区 ACID</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>~$25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TigerGraph Cloud</td>\n<td>GSQL</td>\n<td>托管</td>\n<td>原生分布式</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>~$200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NebulaGraph</td>\n<td>nGQL / Cypher</td>\n<td>自管 / 云</td>\n<td>原生分布式</td>\n<td>否（最终一致）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>按节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图数据库选型信号\">图数据库选型信号</h3><p>图数据库不是通用方案——它在特定查询模式下显著优于关系型，但在其他场景可能更差：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选图数据库的信号</th>\n<th>不选图数据库的信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心查询涉及 ≥3 跳关系遍历</td>\n<td>数据主要是属性查找（点查）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系类型多样（&gt;10 种边类型）</td>\n<td>固定的 1-2 种关系（外键足够）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径查找、最短路径、社区检测</td>\n<td>聚合统计为主（SUM/COUNT/AVG）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 经常变化</td>\n<td>Schema 固定且规范化良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图规模 &lt; 100 亿边</td>\n<td>需要与大量非图数据 JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"向量数据库-语义检索基础设施\">向量数据库：语义检索基础设施</h2><p>向量数据库存储和索引高维嵌入向量（embedding），支持基于相似度的近邻检索。在 LLM/RAG 驱动的 2026 年，它已从实验性工具变成 AI 应用的核心基础设施。</p>\n<p>向量检索的核心操作是<strong>近似最近邻搜索</strong>（ANN）。给定查询向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{q} \\in \\mathbb{R}^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和数据集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\{\\vec{v}_1, ..., \\vec{v}_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，找到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>top-</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{top-}k = \\arg\\min_{S \\subseteq V, |S|=k} \\sum_{\\vec{v} \\in S} dist(\\vec{q}, \\vec{v})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">top-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3932em;vertical-align:-1.3432em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mat