rut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2896em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5104em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>点积：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\vec{q} \\cdot \\vec{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（向量已归一化时等价于余弦）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"向量数据库产品格局-2026\">向量数据库产品格局（2026）</h3><p>2026 年向量数据库市场经历了三大变化：价格崩塌（对象存储 + SSD 缓存模式）、Postgres 阵营崛起（pgvector + pgvectorscale）、以及专用产品的功能分化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>架构特点</th>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>最大向量数</th>\n<th>混合搜索</th>\n<th>月费基准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pinecone Serverless</td>\n<td>对象存储 + 计算分离</td>\n<td>专有 ANN</td>\n<td>数十亿</td>\n<td>元数据过滤</td>\n<td>按读写量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turbopuffer</td>\n<td>S3 + SSD 缓存</td>\n<td>专有</td>\n<td>2.5 万亿（极限测试）</td>\n<td>BM25 + 向量</td>\n<td>极低成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qdrant Cloud</td>\n<td>内存/磁盘混合</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>数十亿</td>\n<td>payload 过滤</td>\n<td>~$25 起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weaviate Cloud</td>\n<td>模块化</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>数亿</td>\n<td>混合（BM25+向量）</td>\n<td>~$25 起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Milvus / Zilliz Cloud</td>\n<td>GPU 加速可选</td>\n<td>IVF + HNSW + DiskANN</td>\n<td>数百亿</td>\n<td>标量过滤</td>\n<td>按 CU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pgvector + pgvectorscale</td>\n<td>PG 扩展</td>\n<td>HNSW + StreamingDiskANN</td>\n<td>数千万</td>\n<td>全部 SQL 能力</td>\n<td>PG 实例费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AlloyDB AI</td>\n<td>PG + ScaNN</td>\n<td>ScaNN</td>\n<td>数亿</td>\n<td>SQL + 全文</td>\n<td>AlloyDB 实例费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"用-postgres-就够-的边界\">「用 Postgres 就够」的边界</h3><p>pgvector 生态在 2026 年显著成熟——pgvectorscale 的 StreamingDiskANN 索引在 50M 向量 / 768 维基准测试中，P95 延迟比 Pinecone s1 低 28x，成本低 75%。但以下场景仍需专用向量数据库：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>为什么 pgvector 不够</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>向量数量 &gt; 1 亿</td>\n<td>HNSW 内存占用爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时索引更新（百万/分钟）</td>\n<td>PG 的 WAL 机制不适合高频向量写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多租户隔离 + 独立 ANN 索引</td>\n<td>PG 的 schema 隔离粒度不够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要 GPU 加速的批量推理</td>\n<td>PG 无 GPU 支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图-向量的融合趋势\">图 + 向量的融合趋势</h2><p>2026 年一个明显趋势是图数据库和向量数据库的能力互相渗透：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Neo4j 增加了向量索引支持（GenAI 插件），允许在图遍历结果上做向量相似度排序</li>\n<li>Weaviate 增加了引用（reference）机制，模拟简单的图关系</li>\n<li>LLM 应用中的 GraphRAG 模式将知识图谱与向量检索结合：先用向量找到相关文档，再用图遍历扩展上下文</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于 RAG 应用的选型决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>知识库特征</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扁平文档集（博客、手册）</td>\n<td>向量数据库 + 分块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化实体关系（组织架构、法规引用）</td>\n<td>图数据库 + 实体嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（文档 + 实体关系）</td>\n<td>GraphRAG（向量 + 图）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简单 QA（&lt; 100 万文档）</td>\n<td>pgvector 嵌入 PG</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本效率对比\">成本效率对比</h2><p>以 1000 万条 1536 维向量（OpenAI text-embedding-3-small 输出）为基准：</p>\n<p>原始数据量 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1536</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> bytes</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>57.3</mn><mtext> GB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7 \\times 1536 \\times 4\\text{ bytes} = 57.3\\text{ GB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1536</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bytes</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">57.3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> GB</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>月存储费</th>\n<th>月查询费（100 QPS 持续）</th>\n<th>总月费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pinecone Serverless（s1）</td>\n<td>~$70</td>\n<td>~$150</td>\n<td>~$220</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pgvectorscale on Neon</td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>计算</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 + 计算</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计算</span></span></span></span></span>50</td>\n<td>含在计算中</td>\n<td>~$70</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qdrant Cloud（1 节点）</td>\n<td>~$90（含计算）</td>\n<td>含在实例中</td>\n<td>~$90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turbopuffer</td>\n<td>~$20（S3）</td>\n<td>~$30</td>\n<td>~$50</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>pgvectorscale 和 Turbopuffer 在中等规模场景下成本优势明显。但 Pinecone 在超大规模（10 亿+向量）和运维零负担方面仍有价值。</p>\n<p>选择完数据库类型后，多种专用库共存的场景需要统一的治理策略——见 <a href=\"../operations-migration/multi-database-polyglot\">多数据库混用架构</a>。图和向量数据库的实际迁移挑战也涉及数据转换管道设计，参见 <a href=\"../operations-migration/migration-strategy-patterns\">迁移策略与模式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>图数据库和向量数据库是 2026 年增长最快的两个数据库细分市场，但它们不是通用方案。图数据库在核心查询涉及 3+ 跳关系遍历时才有结构性优势，否则关系型外键 JOIN 更简单。向量数据库在嵌入规模超过 1000 万条且需要亚秒级语义搜索时才需要独立部署，否则 pgvector/pgvectorscale 嵌入现有 PostgreSQL 是更经济的选择。选型时的关键判断：你的核心查询是精确匹配、关系遍历还是语义近邻？答案直接映射到关系型、图、向量三个方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图数据库与向量数据库选型","id":"图数据库与向量数据库选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图数据库：关系即一等公民","id":"图数据库-关系即一等公民"},{"level":3,"text":"图数据库产品对比","id":"图数据库产品对比"},{"level":3,"text":"图数据库选型信号","id":"图数据库选型信号"},{"level":2,"text":"向量数据库：语义检索基础设施","id":"向量数据库-语义检索基础设施"},{"level":3,"text":"向量数据库产品格局（2026）","id":"向量数据库产品格局-2026"},{"level":3,"text":"「用 Postgres 就够」的边界","id":"用-postgres-就够-的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"图 + 向量的融合趋势","id":"图-向量的融合趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"成本效率对比","id":"成本效率对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/wide-column-timeseries"},"next":{"title":"数据库迁移策略与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/migration-strategy-patterns"}}